WebVn TODO
Sequenced work is derived from the design docs in design-docs/ and is a snapshot
as of 2026-08-25 - the dependency edges hold until the work itself changes them,
the size guesses are worth less.

Sizes: S = hours, M = a day or two, L = several days.


== READY NOW (nothing blocks these) ==

  A  Find-in-file in the editor, on CodeMirror 5             S
       Three addon imports and a stylesheet. Disposable - the CM6 migration
       deletes it - and there is no reason for it to wait behind anything.
       design-docs/EDITOR.md

  B  Keep the Zod schema in the command registry             S
       registerCommandHandler (Parser.ts:37) keeps the handler and discards the
       schema makeZodCmdHandler closed over. Keeping both is what lets
       completions and docs be derived rather than hand-listed.
       design-docs/EDITOR.md

  C  updateLabels returns ParserError instead of throwing    S
       Label.ts:33 throws a bare uncaught Error. Reachable today with a
       duplicate label; becomes routine once includes exist.
       design-docs/SCRIPT_INCLUDES.md

  D  Asset manifest out of demoStory.ts into manifest.yaml   M
       actors/backgrounds/audioAssets are a hardcoded VnPlayerState reaching the
       parser through baseState, so a project cannot declare its own assets.
       Unblocks more than anything else on this list.
       design-docs/PROJECT_STORAGE.md

  E  AssetResolver indirection                               M
       Seven call sites concatenate asset paths (DomRenderer 399/406/411,
       BackgroundRenderer 77/128/160, SpriteRenderer 167, AudioRenderer 16/27).
       One interface behind them makes the storage backend swappable.
       design-docs/PROJECT_STORAGE.md

  F  Parser benchmark at 1k/10k/50k commands, written down   S
       Spike. Settles whether YAML parse time is worth designing around, and
       says which of parse / updateLabels / time-to-first-stop dominates.

  H  Measure the tree-shaken zip.js reader bundle            S
       Spike. Shipped bundles gzip to ~79-85KB but include mime tables,
       encryption and wasm codecs. Decides zip.js against unzipit + client-zip.
       design-docs/PROJECT_STORAGE.md

  T  Behavioural editor tests                                M
       Nothing mounts VnEditor today. Written as "this script produces these
       errors and this player state" they survive the CM6 rewrite; written
       against .CodeMirror-* classes they do not.


